Z||000007||Eric_PA||12-14-2001||09:47 AM||||The HP on a stock HO QUAD-4 is 180HP and the torque I think was around 160 ft#'s Not 100% sure on the torque number||||reg||1
Z||000008||Standard||12-14-2001||01:30 PM||||Torque was rated at 165 lb-ft.  But it peaks much higher up in the powerband than the V6.  It's kind of a tricky engine to get used to.<P>And yeah, ya got the IDI cover on backwards  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">          <BR><FONT COLOR="red">1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed</FONT><BR><FONT SIZE="1"><FONT COLOR="white">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto</FONT><BR><FONT COLOR="blue">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
